d:["$","p","Text workflows also overlap with developer tasks and AI tasks. A clean draft may go into an AI polisher, a diff may verify a code review change, and a symbol library may support UI copy or ecommerce listings.",{"className":"border-l-2 border-blue-200 pl-4 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:border-blue-900 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Text workflows also overlap with developer tasks and AI tasks. A clean draft may go into an AI polisher, a diff may verify a code review change, and a symbol library may support UI copy or ecommerce listings."}]
