,null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Choose explicit cleanup rules so useful formatting is not destroyed."}]]}],["$","tr","Comparison",{"children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"Comparison"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Reviewing copy edits, translations, code snippets, and policy updates"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Text diff"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Use line mode for structure and word mode for prose."}]]}],["$","tr","Publishing polish",{"children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-slate-950 dark:text-white","children":"Publishing polish"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Improving drafts and adding useful characters"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"AI text polisher, translator, symbol library"}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-5 py-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Review AI output for meaning, tone, and factual accuracy."}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]
f:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-slate max-w-none dark:prose-invert prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:tracking-tight prose-p:leading-8 prose-a:text-blue-700","children":[["$","section","Workflow 1: clean copied text before reuse",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Workflow 1: clean copied text before reuse"}],[["$","p","Copied text often carries hidden formatting: tabs from spreadsheets, double spaces from PDFs, broken line wraps from emails, and punctuation that does not fit the target system. Use the text cleaner to remove only the problems you can name.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Copied text often carries hidden formatting: tabs from spreadsheets, double spaces from PDFs, broken line wraps from emails, and punctuation that does not fit the target system. Use the text cleaner to remove only the problems you can name."}]]}],["$","p","Do not blindly strip everything. Removing all punctuation may damage product titles, URLs, code snippets, or legal text. Apply one rule at a time, preview the output, then copy or download the cleaned result.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Do not blindly strip everything. Removing all punctuation may damage product titles, URLs, code snippets, or legal text. Apply one rule at a time, preview the output, then copy or download the cleaned result."}]]}]]]}],["$","section","Workflow 2: compare revisions before publishing",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Workflow 2: compare revisions before publishing"}],[["$","p","Diff tools prevent subtle mistakes. Paste the original version and revised version, then inspect additions, removals, and reordered content. This is useful for release notes, policy updates, translations, documentation, and support macros.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Diff tools prevent subtle mistakes. Paste the original version and revised version, then inspect additions, removals, and reordered content. This is useful for release notes, policy updates, translations, documentation, and support macros."}]]}],["$","p","Line diff works best for structured content such as Markdown, JSON snippets, or lists. Word diff is better when the change is inside a sentence and the review depends on tone, punctuation, or exact phrasing.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Line diff works best for structured content such as Markdown, JSON snippets, or lists. Word diff is better when the change is inside a sentence and the review depends on tone, punctuation, or exact phrasing."}]]}]]]}],["$","section","Workflow 3: prepare text for AI and publishing",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Workflow 3: prepare text for AI and publishing"}],[["$","p","AI tools perform better with clean input. Before polishing or translating a draft, remove accidental line breaks, normalize spacing, and check length constraints. After AI output is generated, use the analyzer and diff tools to review what changed.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"AI tools perform better with clean input. Before polishing or translating a draft, remove accidental line breaks, normalize spacing, and check length constraints. After AI output is generated, use the analyzer and diff tools to review what changed."}]]}],["$","p","For publishing workflows, combine the symbol library with text analysis. Symbols can improve compact labels, documentation, and ecommerce copy, but they should be used intentionally and tested on the target platform.",{"children":["$L17"]}]]]}],"$L18"]}]
